# Keep this directory in git even when empty.
#
# baseline-outputs/ holds the Golden Baseline Outputs for the
# three V1 Packaging Shot Contracts. Each output is a
# human-approved run record: prompt, provider/model, output
# file path, rubric result, human-approval status, known
# limitations. The directory is intentionally empty at P1
# freeze time because the real provider runs are pending
# the user opt-in (see docs/packaging/p1-final-report.md
# §P1-D2 and the comparison protocol in
# tests/fixtures/packaging/jiuzhou/prompts/_PROVENANCE.md).
#
# The schema + run helper are in P1 / D2 (see
# scripts/run-packaging-golden-baseline.mjs). The first
# approved runs will populate:
#   baseline-outputs/hero/jiuzhou.hero.rf.v1/run-1/...
#   baseline-outputs/series/jiuzhou.series.rf.v1/run-1/...
#   baseline-outputs/open/jiuzhou.open.rf.v1/run-1/...
#
# Each run-* subdir is keyed by the goldenPromptId and a
# monotonic run number; the directory is keyed by the shot
# contract. Naming + manifest is frozen; only run-* content
# is added by real provider calls.
